cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: >-
  Heap-Permutations: Heap-type permutation generation with a
  prescribed final arrangement
abstract: >-
  PERMGEN, an ISO C99 library that enumerates all permutations of
  an array with one swap per step using Heap-type schedules with a
  known final arrangement, and a Python program that checks the
  computational claims of the accompanying paper.
type: software
authors:
